1
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,480
I know what happened.

2
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:22,000
Zhuzi.

3
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,839
You brought him here.

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,260
The two of us...

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,899
You know each other?

6
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:33,380
Feng Menglong...

7
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:35,619
He's my own brother.

8
00:00:39,859 --> 00:00:40,240
No way.

9
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,240
What are the odds?

10
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,899
If I'd known he was your brother,

11
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,700
I never would've let them get away!

12
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:46,560
Daguang.

13
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,500
Reimburse Zhuzi for the medical bills he covered.

14
00:00:48,679 --> 00:00:49,020
No, no, no.

15
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:49,820
Don't worry about it, really.

16
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,299
Ziwen, if there's anything I can do, just say the word.

17
00:00:51,619 --> 00:00:52,259
Look, those guys, you know...

18
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:53,280
Even when running off, they were still acting tough.

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:04,680
Zhuzi.

20
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:06,359
We've got plenty of time ahead, brother.

21
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:08,500
Thanks to this young lady today, too.

22
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:09,780
You guys head back first.

23
00:01:10,379 --> 00:01:12,359
We'll handle our own business.

24
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,879
Th-Then I'll get going.

25
00:01:26,659 --> 00:01:27,420
They messed with my brother.

26
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,700
What now, bro?

27
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:36,420
Feng Menglong's family!

28
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,739
Who's Feng Menglong's family?

29
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:38,140
Over here!

30
00:01:38,379 --> 00:01:39,280
The patient needs a blood transfusion right away.

31
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,620
The blood bank has none in stock.

32
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:42,200
Hurry, come over here!

33
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:57,480
Um, Baige...

34
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,200
Are... are you feeling sick?

35
00:01:59,819 --> 00:02:00,799
I'm fine.

36
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,319
I'm in great shape.

37
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,180
Nurse!

38
00:02:04,859 --> 00:02:06,260
Take more. Draw another bottle from me.

39
00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:07,439
Take more? Another—

40
00:02:07,579 --> 00:02:08,560
Nurse, look...

41
00:02:08,979 --> 00:02:09,259
How about this:

42
00:02:09,379 --> 00:02:10,400
Take some of mine instead.

43
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:12,199
What blood type?

44
00:02:12,259 --> 00:02:13,460
Wait, blood types can be different?

45
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,620
We're full siblings, how could it—

46
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,180
Bro.

47
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:17,139
This is a hospital.

48
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:18,180
Stop making a racket.

49
00:02:26,939 --> 00:02:27,400
Look at you.

50
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,500
Your hands are ice-cold.

51
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:30,879
I'm fine.

52
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,379
I'm not that delicate.

53
00:02:36,139 --> 00:02:37,439
Go get Menglong's paperwork sorted.

54
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,400
Right.

55
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:41,240
I'll go do that.

56
00:02:58,780 --> 00:02:59,400
Sit down. Sit.

57
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,520
I'm fine. What are you doing?

58
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,439
Menglong will be fine.

59
00:03:16,439 --> 00:03:18,800
Didn't that old blind fortuneteller read his fortune?

60
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,860
He said he's blessed by the Star of Wisdom,

61
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:23,120
destined for great fortune,

62
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,500
and would live to be 88.

63
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:25,780
Did you forget?

64
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,620
I swore an oath

65
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:35,180
that I'd protect both of you.

66
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,539
You're here.

67
00:04:05,099 --> 00:04:05,740
How is he?

68
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:07,439
He's basically stabilized.

69
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:08,780
But due to severe blood loss,

70
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,060
and on top of that, the shock,

71
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:11,580
he's very weak right now.

72
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,240
Don't worry, though.

73
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,419
Once he gets a good rest,

74
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,259
he'll be fine when he wakes up.

75
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:17,759
Thank you, Doctor.

76
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,439
You're welcome.

77
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:24,920
Menglong's going to be okay.

78
00:04:41,139 --> 00:04:42,240
I've got things covered here.

79
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,360
Go do what you have to do.

80
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,959
Shouldn't you have turned back there?

81
00:05:02,079 --> 00:05:03,079
You're hurt.

82
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,699
I need to get you home first.

83
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:06,839
No need.

84
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:07,639
I'm fine.

85
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:08,500
Just let me off.

86
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:09,560
I can walk back myself.

87
00:05:09,819 --> 00:05:10,540
Shut up.

88
00:05:13,459 --> 00:05:14,220
Keep talking.

89
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:17,959
I mean, my hand's hurt,

90
00:05:18,060 --> 00:05:19,519
not my legs. I can walk.

91
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:21,060
Not that.

92
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:23,899
About Feng Ziwen, the Eastern Tyrant.

93
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,199
And then?

94
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:26,339
Ziwen...

95
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:28,819
Ziwen.

96
00:05:29,740 --> 00:05:31,519
I remember when I first met him,

97
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,180
he seemed pretty gentle,

98
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,120
like a student.

99
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,459
What about that girl, Chen Baige?

100
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,620
Skinny and petite.

101
00:05:38,779 --> 00:05:40,879
Who knew five years would change them so much.

102
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:42,879
Changed how?

103
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:46,620
They look the same,

104
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,560
but they feel completely different now.

105
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:51,779
Then...

106
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,660
do you think they're good or bad?

107
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:58,139
Hard to say.

108
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:01,500
You hang out with them without even knowing?

109
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,399
You've got some nerve.

110
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,879
Don't get mixed up in their fighting.

111
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,139
You... you need to stay out of trouble.

112
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:08,959
Got that?

113
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:11,860
Are you tired?

114
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,060
Want me to ride for a bit?

115
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:13,980
I'm fine.

116
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:14,920
I've got plenty of strength.

117
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:16,779
Hold on tight.

118
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,000
I'm holding on.

119
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:19,800
My hands are just a little cold.

120
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:21,680
Freezing, huh?

121
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:22,660
Put them in my pockets.

122
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:25,000
Is that okay?

123
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,579
Don't mind if I do, then.

124
00:06:30,259 --> 00:06:31,079
It really is pretty cold.

125
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:34,980
I swore

126
00:07:35,579 --> 00:07:37,319
I'd protect both of you.

127
00:07:37,879 --> 00:07:38,899
I believe you,

128
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,220
Brother Ziwen.

129
00:07:43,139 --> 00:07:43,879
Bro...

130
00:07:48,139 --> 00:07:48,779
Today...

131
00:07:49,939 --> 00:07:50,740
I'm gonna make them...

132
00:07:52,579 --> 00:07:53,199
I'm so cold...

133
00:07:57,019 --> 00:07:59,959
Speaking of today's battle at the shipyard,

134
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,899
it was a total victory!

135
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,139
First,

136
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:06,819
we taught a lesson

137
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:09,779
to that snobbish pretty boy, Feng Menglong,

138
00:08:11,259 --> 00:08:13,300
bringing pride to us West Suburb boys!

139
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,620
Second,

140
00:08:15,860 --> 00:08:18,519
we also taught that tall guy

141
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,199
who stole the bike a lesson!

142
00:08:19,319 --> 00:08:21,759
Talk about killing two birds with one stone!

143
00:08:22,819 --> 00:08:24,519
But most importantly,

144
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,100
my big brother, Li Laogunzi,

145
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:29,279
has come to town to run the turf!

146
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,939
Badass!

147
00:08:31,319 --> 00:08:32,960
From now on, those city folks

148
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,360
will have to think twice when they see us!

149
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,139
Am I right?

150
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,039
Damn right!

151
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:38,919
In the past, the girls and young wives on the street

152
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:40,159
wouldn't even look at us.

153
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:41,600
And those factory kids,

154
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,139
flaunting their iron rice bowls,

155
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:44,259
acted like they were better than everyone.

156
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,039
Look at 'em now!

157
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,779
Bro, today felt so damn good!

158
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,600
Right here, right now,

159
00:08:49,899 --> 00:08:51,519
I just wanna recite a poem!

160
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:57,879
Today's battle was fierce and grand,

161
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:01,220
Brother Li's kicks were tough and grand,

162
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:04,740
beat the pretty boy black and blue,

163
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:08,519
shaking Songliao, flattening the whole damn town!

164
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,820
You even threw in "damn"?

165
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:13,139
Is that how you embarrass yourself at poetry clubs?

166
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,659
Besides, you're bragging way too much!

167
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,240
You bunch of losers,

168
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:17,840
at the factory gate,

169
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,899
got your asses handed to you!

170
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,379
And you still have the nerve to gloat here?

171
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,720
We still got Brother Li!

172
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:25,080
If those factory workers hadn't stepped in today,

173
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,539
we would've flattened their entire factory!

174
00:09:27,159 --> 00:09:29,620
From now on, those bastards in overalls

175
00:09:29,639 --> 00:09:31,360
will learn not to mess with us!

176
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,019
Still, Brother Li,

177
00:09:34,379 --> 00:09:35,340
do you know who the biggest boss

178
00:09:35,419 --> 00:09:37,059
in the city is right now?

179
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:38,200
Who?

180
00:09:40,299 --> 00:09:41,480
Eastern Tyrant.

181
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:44,080
If we wanna run the turf,

182
00:09:44,299 --> 00:09:46,559
we need a badass name!

183
00:09:47,299 --> 00:09:48,539
Aren't they called Eastern Tyrant?

184
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:50,659
You represent the West Suburbs,

185
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,740
so we'll be West Tyrant...

186
00:09:57,159 --> 00:09:57,759
West Tyrant...

187
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:58,679
West Tyrant...

188
00:09:58,799 --> 00:09:59,259
West Tyrant...

189
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:00,240
Sounds great!

190
00:10:01,139 --> 00:10:01,860
Tyrant of the West!

191
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:04,980
Tyrant of the West! Tyrant of the West! Tyrant of the West!

192
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,179
What are you doing?

193
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:22,539
I'm listening here.

194
00:10:22,659 --> 00:10:23,399
Not asleep?

195
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,840
Who's sleeping?

196
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,259
What kind of junk are you listening to?

197
00:10:29,279 --> 00:10:30,320
Doesn't even sound like storytelling.

198
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,440
Come on, take a seat.

199
00:10:36,259 --> 00:10:37,059
Never heard of it, right?

200
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:38,820
It's a foreign classic.

201
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:39,759
*Gone with the Wind*.

202
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,580
Looks to me like you're getting carried away.

203
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:44,279
What are you talking about?

204
00:10:44,379 --> 00:10:46,000
I'm trying to study here.

205
00:10:46,980 --> 00:10:49,259
You've never studied a day in your life.

206
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:51,059
Seeing you sit so still like this,

207
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,539
why does it make me so uneasy?

208
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,600
Are you cooking up some nasty trouble?

209
00:10:57,139 --> 00:10:59,019
Can't you just wish me well for once?

210
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,220
Alright, alright.

211
00:11:01,299 --> 00:11:01,940
You should just go to sleep.

212
00:11:01,940 --> 00:11:02,980
Come on, move, move.

213
00:11:03,659 --> 00:11:04,179
Off you go.

214
00:11:04,820 --> 00:11:05,299
Go on, drift off.

215
00:11:08,779 --> 00:11:09,519
Doesn't know a damn thing.

216
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,440
This room.

217
00:11:15,620 --> 00:11:16,100
Wait, no.

218
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,600
This one.

219
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:22,220
217.

220
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,039
Zhuzi.

221
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:35,120
Zhuzi!

222
00:11:36,539 --> 00:11:38,299
Seriously, is a decent study environment

223
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,399
too much to ask for?

224
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:40,820
Who is it?

225
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,220
What's up, Daguang?

226
00:11:46,259 --> 00:11:47,600
What do you need so late at night?

227
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,399
Let's go.

228
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:49,960
My brother told me to take you somewhere.

229
00:11:53,379 --> 00:11:54,759
What are we doing out here in the middle of the night?

230
00:11:54,940 --> 00:11:55,580
It's freezing.

231
00:11:56,100 --> 00:11:56,960
Don't worry.

232
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:59,519
There's bound to be a show in a minute.

233
00:12:14,779 --> 00:12:16,379
What are you doing? Catching fish?

234
00:12:17,659 --> 00:12:18,240
Any fish?

235
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:26,799
Here comes a big fish.

236
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,840
The real target's right here.

237
00:12:41,179 --> 00:12:42,080
I didn't finish you off,

238
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,340
and you went and brought backup?

239
00:12:53,700 --> 00:12:54,879
You're beaten to a pulp,

240
00:12:55,379 --> 00:12:56,279
and you still won't yield?

241
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,600
I'm the Eastern Tyrant.

242
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,419
Today at the shipyard,

243
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:10,080
the guy you beat half to death...

244
00:13:10,659 --> 00:13:11,340
was my brother.

245
00:13:12,580 --> 00:13:13,379
My own blood brother.

246
00:13:13,779 --> 00:13:15,259
So you're the Eastern Tyrant, huh?

247
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:16,840
I thought you were actually tough.

248
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,919
All you know is fighting dirty.

249
00:13:18,100 --> 00:13:18,799
Bullshit!

250
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:19,960
If you've got the balls, let me go!

251
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,759
Let's go one-on-one!

252
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:21,480
Screw you!

253
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:22,659
Now you want a one-on-one, huh?

254
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:23,899
When four or five of you

255
00:13:23,940 --> 00:13:25,519
jumped my brother alone, what were you thinking?

256
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,360
Today,

257
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:29,419
who hit my brother with a brick?

258
00:13:31,639 --> 00:13:32,659
I did.

259
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:33,700
What about it?

260
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:38,820
Quit squirming!

261
00:13:42,759 --> 00:13:43,379
Drag them

262
00:13:44,539 --> 00:13:45,799
over to the ice hole.

263
00:13:46,299 --> 00:13:46,659
What are you gonna do?!

264
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,200
Move it!

265
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,120
On your knees!

266
00:13:54,299 --> 00:13:56,460
You two, strip off his clothes.

267
00:13:56,460 --> 00:13:57,639
Shove his head in.

268
00:13:58,259 --> 00:13:58,700
Brother!

269
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,100
Brother, we didn't know who we were messing with!

270
00:14:01,259 --> 00:14:02,419
Please, spare us!

271
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:04,440
We're so sorry!

272
00:14:04,539 --> 00:14:05,539
We apologize!

273
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:08,480
What about my brother, then?

274
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,419
A scholar,

275
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:11,980
a harmless intellectual...

276
00:14:12,639 --> 00:14:14,000
beaten in broad daylight,

277
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,159
put into the hospital by you scum,

278
00:14:15,159 --> 00:14:16,000
almost losing his damn life!

279
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,120
If you don't settle this debt,

280
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,480
how do I face my brother?

281
00:14:24,419 --> 00:14:26,039
Ziwen, is this really okay?

282
00:14:26,179 --> 00:14:27,899
I heard they're still gonna corner you at the plant.

283
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:30,620
Will the girl by your side be safe?

284
00:14:31,019 --> 00:14:32,120
Zhuzi, these bastards

285
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,259
only prey on the weak.

286
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,940
If you don't teach them a lesson today,

287
00:14:34,940 --> 00:14:36,259
they'll sniff you out and come right back tomorrow.

288
00:14:39,179 --> 00:14:39,639
Zhuzi.

289
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:41,720
Mercy to those who want you dead

290
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,879
is cruelty to your own people.

291
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,259
Go on.

292
00:14:46,460 --> 00:14:47,059
You do it yourself.

293
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:47,759
Brother!

294
00:14:48,019 --> 00:14:49,720
Brother, please spare Brother Li!

295
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,720
Brother, I'm begging you!

296
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,519
Hurry the hell up!

297
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,320
Or else all three of you strip down today!
